THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
    Some artifacts in this repository are derived from, or reproduce, work by
    others. They keep their original license and attribution, declared in the
    file or directory that contains them. In particular:

    - The compaction-extraction task specification in coding-agents/ is an
      experimental input preserved verbatim; the candidate deliverables it
      produced are not in this repository, they live in
      compaction-extraction-benchmark, where the upstream MIT license of
      deepseek-harness (Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek) is reproduced in full
      and governs them.
    - Measurements and analyses reference Lucebox (Luce-Org/lucebox,
      Apache-2.0) and llama.cpp (ggml-org/llama.cpp, MIT). No third-party
      source code is vendored here.

    Experimental artifacts are preserved verbatim and are not relicensed by
